    "slug": "visa-requirements-saudi-arabia",
    "title": "Saudi Arabia Visa Requirements for Nigerians",
    "content": "Complete guide to obtaining a Saudi visa for Hajj or Umrah from Nigeria.\n\n## Required Documents\n- Valid passport (6+ months validity)\n- Passport-size photographs (white background)\n- Meningitis vaccination certificate\n- Completed visa application form\n- Confirmed return ticket\n- Hotel booking confirmation\n\n## Process\n1. Register with a licensed travel agency (like Minhaajulhudaa)\n2. Submit required documents\n3. Wait for visa processing (5-7 business days)\n4. Receive e-visa\n\n## Important Notes\n- Visas are only issued through authorized agencies\n- Hajj visas have specific application windows\n- Umrah visas are available year-round (except during Hajj season)\n\nMinhaajulhudaa Travels handles all visa processing for our clients at no additional cost.",
    "category": "visa",
