    "title": "Complete Packing Checklist for Umrah",
    "content": "Everything you need to pack for a comfortable Umrah journey.\n\n## Documents\n- Passport\n- Visa\n- Flight tickets\n- Hotel booking confirmation\n- Vaccination certificate\n- Travel insurance\n\n## Clothing\n- 2 sets of Ihram (for men)\n- Modest clothing for women\n- Comfortable walking shoes\n- Sandals/flip-flops\n- Light jacket (for air conditioning)\n\n## Personal Items\n- Unscented toiletries\n- Medications\n- Prayer mat (travel)\n- Quran\n- Dua book\n- Water bottle\n- Umbrella\n\n## Electronics\n- Phone and charger\n- Power bank\n- Universal adapter\n- Headphones\n\n## Misc\n- Small backpack\n- Reusable shopping bag\n- Snacks\n- Tissues\n\nPack light - you will be carrying your luggage frequently.",
